# ripgrep/rg precedence file (higher priority than .gitignore).
#
# The repo .gitignore is a block-everything security file ("*" then a tiny
# whitelist) whose ONLY job is keeping secrets out of `git push`. It should not
# blind local code search. Re-include the working tree for rg, then re-exclude
# genuine junk so results stay useful.
!**

# keep true noise out of search results
.git/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.lance/
*.exe
